Package: tragweite
Title: Simulation-Based Design Planning for Precision Psychotherapy
    Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christian", "Obeser", email = "gersari99@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Answers the question that comes before any precision
    psychotherapy study: can this design detect the effect it is
    looking for? Simulation-based power and design-sensitivity
    analysis for treatment-effect heterogeneity and patient-therapist
    matching effects under therapist nesting (caseloads, intraclass
    correlations, session counts), built on the validated 'windkanal'
    simulation engine. For these questions no closed-form power
    formulas exist; simulation is the only honest answer.
